---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="media">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Media information</span><h1>Press and brand information.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">This page contains a short description of the society and its logo files. Contact the organizing team before publishing claims about events, sponsors, or partners.</p></div>
    <div class="page-hero__side"><figure class="page-hero__figure"><img src="assets/images/photos/circuit-board-dark.jpg" width="1200" height="960" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="A black circuit board on a dark background"></figure><aside class="page-hero__aside"><strong>Media inquiries</strong><p>Use the <a class="text-link" href="contact">contact form</a> and select “Media request.”</p></aside></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Short description</span><h2>About the society</h2><p>The Oberlin 3-2 Engineering Society is a student group being organized for Oberlin students interested in engineering and the 3-2 program. Its planned work includes student projects, technical events, and links to advising resources. Membership interest is open to students in any major or class year.</p></div>
    <figure class="photo-frame"><img src="assets/images/photos/bench-multimeter.jpg" alt="An electronics bench with a multimeter and hand tools" width="1400" height="1050" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Logo files</span><h2>Use the supplied artwork without redrawing it.</h2></div><p>Keep clear space around the emblem, preserve its proportions, and avoid placing it over a visually busy background.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
      <article class="card"><div class="logo-panel logo-panel--dark"><img src="assets/images/iglogo-900.webp" alt="Oberlin 3-2 Engineering Society emblem" width="900" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="card__footer"><strong>Official emblem</strong><a class="text-link" href="assets/images/iglogo.png" download>Download PNG</a></div></article>
      <article class="card brand-use-card"><span class="card__number">Usage</span><h3>Keep the mark intact.</h3><ul class="operating-list"><li>Preserve the square proportions.</li><li>Leave clear space around the outer ring.</li><li>Use a calm, high-contrast background.</li><li>Do not recolor, crop, stretch, or redraw it.</li></ul></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Brand colors</span><h2>Maroon, gold, and paper.</h2></div><p>Maintain readable contrast and do not use color as the only way to communicate status.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card brand-swatch brand-swatch--maroon"><i></i><div><strong>Maroon</strong><p>#7B1230</p></div></article>
      <article class="card brand-swatch brand-swatch--gold"><i></i><div><strong>Gold</strong><p>#D9A526</p></div></article>
      <article class="card brand-swatch brand-swatch--paper"><i></i><div><strong>Paper</strong><p>#F2F4F6</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Image sources</span><h2>Current images are placeholders.</h2><p>The website uses generated images and licensed stock photographs. Photos from society activities will be added only with permission.</p></div><ul class="check-list"><li>Ask identifiable students before publishing their image.</li><li>Record the creator, source, and license.</li><li>Do not describe stock or generated subjects as society members.</li><li>Describe meaningful images in alt text.</li></ul></div>
</section>
</Layout>
